Why This Is Asked
- Tests ability to design cross-service coordination with strict tenant isolation.
- Evaluates how to version events, handle retroactive changes, and implement compensating actions.
- Probes outbox usage, idempotence, and read-model consistency in a multi-tenant setup.

Key Concepts
- Event-sourced CQRS per tenant
- Saga orchestration with compensations
- Versioned events and outbox-based commands
- Idempotent handlers using tenantId + eventId

Code Example
